{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["And the word <b>נשקד</b> — it has no father or mother [i.e., no known root], and the meaning is like נמשך [drawn], like נמהר." "And <b>ישתרגו</b> — is from the hitpa'el pattern, from the family of שריגים [tendrils]." "<b>הכשיל</b> — he returns to the yoke of my transgressions, and 'asher is missing after בידי. Also after קום: either עמו or מפניו."], :book :lamentations, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Lamentations -- Wikisource" "https://he.wikisource.org/wiki/%D7%90%D7%91%D7%9F_%D7%A2%D7%96%D7%A8%D7%90_%D7%A2%D7%9C_%D7%9E%D7%92%D7%99%D7%9C%D7%AA_%D7%90%D7%99%D7%9B%D7%94"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:07:27.746313898Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}